/-!
# The thin diagram `F73`

BO13a figure 7.3 (category 44): the pentagon `x → c → y₀`, `x → a → b → y₀` with `a → y₁ ← b' ← a' → tz`.

Generated by `scripts/gen_thin_shape.py`.
-/

@[expose] public section

